  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "不喝就是看不起我领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病，这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密，嘴硬，不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。领导的格局，可惜就是刺夺领导。您看虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。来就来，带什么礼物啊，都不是外人。哎呀，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊，打这么多饭，你喂猪呢？领导，我哪敢啊，我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼太多了。领导哦，我虽然心耳多，但也是那下酒菜呀。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈小王，你这菜点的也太多了。领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾。多这杯酒，我先敬您。小李，最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬一杯。听这意思，领导也要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导一杯。哎，你什么意思啊？怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。领导美满美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子没满，就是一辈子没满啊。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，和你这么漂亮的女孩吃饭，不用喝就已经醉了。领导，您真幽默，您还没沾久，就让我沾光了，今天让你破费了。领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方向您请教。不是啊，哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，你酒量挺好的。呀张总，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯。哈哈哈哈哈年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。哈哈哈哈哈哈小汪啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。个高是为了给领导探路走，哪不还是得听领导指挥吗？哈哈哈小王儿啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。你一开口就让人喜欢你，你是怎么做到的？因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，那些会说话、会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交。推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若冰，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，这个真是让我一解心开啊。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下应该怎么说。书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 2850,
      "text": "不喝就是看不起我领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3570,
      "end_ms": 4710,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5070,
      "end_ms": 6030,
      "text": "我是看不起病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8850,
      "end_ms": 10210,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10990,
      "end_ms": 11830,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13010,
      "end_ms": 13450,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13450,
      "end_ms": 14530,
      "text": "才守得住秘密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17250,
      "end_ms": 17650,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17670,
      "end_ms": 18610,
      "text": "不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19410,
      "end_ms": 21410,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21410,
      "end_ms": 23670,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26230,
      "end_ms": 27870,
      "text": "领导的格局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00013",
      "start_ms": 27870,
      "end_ms": 30820,
      "text": "可惜就是刺夺领导。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30820,
      "end_ms": 32120,
      "text": "您看虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00015",
      "start_ms": 32140,
      "end_ms": 34820,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36200,
      "end_ms": 36800,
      "text": "来就来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00017",
      "start_ms": 36900,
      "end_ms": 37940,
      "text": "带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00018",
      "start_ms": 37960,
      "end_ms": 38900,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00019",
      "start_ms": 39000,
      "end_ms": 39380,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00020",
      "start_ms": 39400,
      "end_ms": 40040,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00021",
      "start_ms": 40040,
      "end_ms": 40740,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00022",
      "start_ms": 40820,
      "end_ms": 42360,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00023",
      "start_ms": 42520,
      "end_ms": 44700,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00024",
      "start_ms": 45540,
      "end_ms": 46320,
      "text": "打这么多饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00025",
      "start_ms": 46320,
      "end_ms": 47020,
      "text": "你喂猪呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00026",
      "start_ms": 47380,
      "end_ms": 47800,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00027",
      "start_ms": 47920,
      "end_ms": 48700,
      "text": "我哪敢啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00028",
      "start_ms": 48860,
      "end_ms": 51100,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00029",
      "start_ms": 51100,
      "end_ms": 52600,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00030",
      "start_ms": 52740,
      "end_ms": 53960,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00031",
      "start_ms": 55640,
      "end_ms": 56840,
      "text": "这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00032",
      "start_ms": 57260,
      "end_ms": 58220,
      "text": "就是心眼太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00033",
      "start_ms": 58220,
      "end_ms": 59420,
      "text": "领导哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00034",
      "start_ms": 60020,
      "end_ms": 60880,
      "text": "我虽然心耳多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00035",
      "start_ms": 60940,
      "end_ms": 62155,
      "text": "但也是那下酒菜呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00036",
      "start_ms": 62970,
      "end_ms": 65225,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈小王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00037",
      "start_ms": 65570,
      "end_ms": 67065,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00038",
      "start_ms": 67650,
      "end_ms": 69230,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00039",
      "start_ms": 69230,
      "end_ms": 70590,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00040",
      "start_ms": 70590,
      "end_ms": 71290,
      "text": "多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00041",
      "start_ms": 71330,
      "end_ms": 72065,
      "text": "我先敬您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00042",
      "start_ms": 73930,
      "end_ms": 74270,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00043",
      "start_ms": 74270,
      "end_ms": 75375,
      "text": "最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00044",
      "start_ms": 75700,
      "end_ms": 77295,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00045",
      "start_ms": 77820,
      "end_ms": 78905,
      "text": "我得提前敬一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00046",
      "start_ms": 79200,
      "end_ms": 79940,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00047",
      "start_ms": 80020,
      "end_ms": 81125,
      "text": "领导也要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00048",
      "start_ms": 81420,
      "end_ms": 82600,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00049",
      "start_ms": 83940,
      "end_ms": 84265,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00050",
      "start_ms": 84750,
      "end_ms": 85535,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00051",
      "start_ms": 85790,
      "end_ms": 87035,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00052",
      "start_ms": 87350,
      "end_ms": 88890,
      "text": "领导美满美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00053",
      "start_ms": 88910,
      "end_ms": 89835,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00054",
      "start_ms": 90140,
      "end_ms": 91020,
      "text": "这一辈子没满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00055",
      "start_ms": 91020,
      "end_ms": 92185,
      "text": "就是一辈子没满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00056",
      "start_ms": 92450,
      "end_ms": 93595,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00057",
      "start_ms": 93800,
      "end_ms": 95635,
      "text": "和你这么漂亮的女孩吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00058",
      "start_ms": 95990,
      "end_ms": 97505,
      "text": "不用喝就已经醉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00059",
      "start_ms": 98100,
      "end_ms": 98500,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00060",
      "start_ms": 98580,
      "end_ms": 99355,
      "text": "您真幽默，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00061",
      "start_ms": 99700,
      "end_ms": 100500,
      "text": "您还没沾久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00062",
      "start_ms": 100560,
      "end_ms": 101595,
      "text": "就让我沾光了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00063",
      "start_ms": 103770,
      "end_ms": 104785,
      "text": "今天让你破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00064",
      "start_ms": 105110,
      "end_ms": 105575,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00065",
      "start_ms": 105880,
      "end_ms": 107340,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00066",
      "start_ms": 107340,
      "end_ms": 108105,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00067",
      "start_ms": 108610,
      "end_ms": 110130,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00068",
      "start_ms": 110130,
      "end_ms": 110915,
      "text": "不是啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00069",
      "start_ms": 111410,
      "end_ms": 112715,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00070",
      "start_ms": 112900,
      "end_ms": 113860,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00071",
      "start_ms": 113860,
      "end_ms": 114880,
      "text": "呀张总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00072",
      "start_ms": 114940,
      "end_ms": 115895,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00073",
      "start_ms": 116060,
      "end_ms": 117195,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00074",
      "start_ms": 117490,
      "end_ms": 118790,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00075",
      "start_ms": 118790,
      "end_ms": 119290,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00076",
      "start_ms": 119310,
      "end_ms": 120825,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00077",
      "start_ms": 121050,
      "end_ms": 124135,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00078",
      "start_ms": 124720,
      "end_ms": 126025,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00079",
      "start_ms": 126270,
      "end_ms": 127350,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00080",
      "start_ms": 127530,
      "end_ms": 128775,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00081",
      "start_ms": 129800,
      "end_ms": 132015,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈小汪啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00082",
      "start_ms": 132530,
      "end_ms": 134030,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00083",
      "start_ms": 134030,
      "end_ms": 134995,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00084",
      "start_ms": 135720,
      "end_ms": 137540,
      "text": "个高是为了给领导探路走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00085",
      "start_ms": 137540,
      "end_ms": 139015,
      "text": "哪不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00086",
      "start_ms": 139850,
      "end_ms": 141965,
      "text": "哈哈哈小王儿啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00087",
      "start_ms": 142430,
      "end_ms": 144065,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00088",
      "start_ms": 144490,
      "end_ms": 147035,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00089",
      "start_ms": 147390,
      "end_ms": 149530,
      "text": "只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00090",
      "start_ms": 150790,
      "end_ms": 152415,
      "text": "你一开口就让人喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00091",
      "start_ms": 152650,
      "end_ms": 153565,
      "text": "你是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00092",
      "start_ms": 153870,
      "end_ms": 156010,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00093",
      "start_ms": 156190,
      "end_ms": 157970,
      "text": "这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00094",
      "start_ms": 158030,
      "end_ms": 159890,
      "text": "那些会说话、会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00095",
      "start_ms": 160030,
      "end_ms": 161130,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00096",
      "start_ms": 161270,
      "end_ms": 161950,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00097",
      "start_ms": 162090,
      "end_ms": 162910,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00098",
      "start_ms": 163030,
      "end_ms": 164285,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00099",
      "start_ms": 164610,
      "end_ms": 166535,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00100",
      "start_ms": 166840,
      "end_ms": 169025,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00101",
      "start_ms": 169380,
      "end_ms": 170560,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00102",
      "start_ms": 170700,
      "end_ms": 172075,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00103",
      "start_ms": 172360,
      "end_ms": 174980,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00104",
      "start_ms": 175100,
      "end_ms": 176480,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00105",
      "start_ms": 176500,
      "end_ms": 177405,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00106",
      "start_ms": 177730,
      "end_ms": 177870,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00107",
      "start_ms": 177870,
      "end_ms": 179945,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00108",
      "start_ms": 180170,
      "end_ms": 180855,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00109",
      "start_ms": 181320,
      "end_ms": 182300,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00110",
      "start_ms": 182340,
      "end_ms": 183635,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00111",
      "start_ms": 184010,
      "end_ms": 185650,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00112",
      "start_ms": 185750,
      "end_ms": 187475,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00113",
      "start_ms": 187790,
      "end_ms": 188635,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00114",
      "start_ms": 188880,
      "end_ms": 191900,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00115",
      "start_ms": 191960,
      "end_ms": 193140,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00116",
      "start_ms": 193340,
      "end_ms": 194615,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00117",
      "start_ms": 194920,
      "end_ms": 196260,
      "text": "强将手下吴若冰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00118",
      "start_ms": 196540,
      "end_ms": 197985,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00119",
      "start_ms": 198220,
      "end_ms": 199560,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00120",
      "start_ms": 199640,
      "end_ms": 201495,
      "text": "这个真是让我一解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00121",
      "start_ms": 201770,
      "end_ms": 203025,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00122",
      "start_ms": 203370,
      "end_ms": 206490,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00123",
      "start_ms": 206770,
      "end_ms": 209435,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00124",
      "start_ms": 209680,
      "end_ms": 211000,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00125",
      "start_ms": 211360,
      "end_ms": 212780,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00126",
      "start_ms": 213000,
      "end_ms": 215455,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00127",
      "start_ms": 215800,
      "end_ms": 216880,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00128",
      "start_ms": 217080,
      "end_ms": 219475,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d66d5d68290f0e95_s00129",
      "start_ms": 219880,
      "end_ms": 221555,
      "text": "这本书真的可以帮助到大家。"
    }
  ],
